[l_english.STATE_LORE_214]
New Ponyville, a small village before the Ultimate Battle, suddenly faced a large influx of refugees from Equestria after the Ultimate Battle. It was obvious that the capital could not accommodate so many ponies to feed, so part of the ponies, encouraged by the government, chose to explore other areas and settle down. The pony immigrants established several new settlements, and New Ponyville was one of them.

When the immigrants arrived here, they encountered resistance from the local aborigines. The two parties lived through this conflict, with occasional violent incidents. The turning point came when a pony discovered that the land here was very suitable for growing apples, and the unique climate conditions of Storm Island could even produce green apples of better quality and higher yield than those in Equestria. With the apple industry, the place developed rapidly. Once deeply divided species now set aside their prejudices and worked together to manage their vast apple orchards. Just like the Apple family once did in Equestria, now again, New Ponyville is established. It has become a model area where various species live in harmony.

Today, New Ponyville has developed rapidly with apples and surrounding industries. Different species live together, blending and permeating each other’s lives, creating a unique new culture. For example, the “Hooves and Claws Festival” celebrated by ponies and griffons together, and the celebration activities that integrate the traditional customs of the storm creatures.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_214]
纽伯尼维尔在终末之战前不过是个小村庄。但在终末之战结束后。大量小马利亚难民涌入风暴岛。显然首都是无法完全容纳那么多马口的，于是部分小马在政府鼓励下选择了探索其他地区并定居下来。小马移民建立了数个新定居点，而纽伯尼维尔就是其中之一。

当小马移民来到此处时，遭到了当地原住民的抵抗。两者在这种矛盾的情况下生活着，时不时发生暴力事件。时期的转机发生在一匹小马发现这里的土地很适合种植苹果，而风暴岛独特的气候条件甚至能产生比小马利亚质量更好，产量更高的绿苹果。靠着苹果产业，这里得到了迅速发展。原本矛盾深刻的各族放下了成见，一起经营着广阔的苹果园。就如同当年小马利亚的苹果家族一样，纽伯尼维尔建立了起来。成为了各个种族和谐相处的模范地区。

如今的纽伯尼维尔靠着苹果和周边产业发展得很快，当地各个种族的生活相互融合渗透，产生了独特的新文化。例如小马与狮鹫一同庆祝的“爪蹄节”，以及融合了风暴兽们传统的庆典活动。
